package Libraries.Web.Page.Standards

/*
    ComputerScienceStandards2026 is the 2026 CSTA K–12 Computer Science
    Standards: every standard, with its level, concept and subconcept, and
    a constant for each one. A constant's name spells out where the
    standard sits: its level, its specialty (for specialty standards), its
    subconcept, and its number in the set, so HS-PRO-PD-12 is
    HIGH_SCHOOL_PROGRAM_DEVELOPMENT_12. Use the constants, so a mistyped
    standard fails to compile.

    This class was converted once from the standards' published table
    (CSTA2026.csv, 331 standards, 2026-10-30). The table isn't read when a
    site is built. If the standards change, convert them again.

    Attribute: Example
    use Libraries.Web.Page.Standards.ComputerScienceStandards2026
    use Libraries.Web.Page.Standards.Standard

    ComputerScienceStandards2026 standards
    Standard standard = standards:GetStandard(standards:HIGH_SCHOOL_PROGRAM_DEVELOPMENT_12)
    output standard:GetText()
*/
class ComputerScienceStandards2026 is StandardSet
